Initially, the pair of [[Susilo Bambang Yudhoyono]] and [[Boediono]] was referred to [[Colloquialism|colloquially]] by the Indonesian media as ''SBY Berbudi''.<ref name="SP abbreviations"/> Three days after the slogan was announced, the campaign team had changed its name to ''SBY–Boediono'' due to concerns that the term ''berbudi'' was not as well known outside [[Java]].<ref>{{cite news | title = Slogan SBY Berbudi Diganti SBY-Boediono | url = http://nasional.kompas.com/read/xml/2009/05/18/17231272/Slogan.SBY.Berbudi.Diganti.SBY-Boediono | publisher = [[Kompas]] | date = 2009-05-18 | accessdate = 2009-05-26|language=id}}</ref>

